    <title class="- topic/title "><ph class="- topic/ph topic/title-wrapper ">What is Sum-up of numbers</ph></title>
    <shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Here you will learn what is sum-up</shortdesc>
    <conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody ">
        <p class="- topic/p ">Subtraction is the process of finding the <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">addition between two numbers</b> by taking
            adding number into  another. </p>
        <p class="- topic/p ">When using a calculator, you <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">enter the first number</b>, <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">press the plus (+)</b>
            button, <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">enter the second number</b>, <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">then press equals (=)</b> to get the
            result.</p>
        <p class="- topic/p "> It shows how much remains after adding  one value into another.</p>
    </conbody>
</concept><task class="- topic/topic task/task " id="unique_2" topicrefclass="- map/topicref " nd:nd-id="how_to_subtract_numbers" oid="how_to_subtract_numbers" specializations="@props/deliveryTarget">
