    <title class="- topic/title "><ph class="- topic/ph topic/title-wrapper ">What is divide of numbers</ph></title>
    <shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Here you will learn what is division</shortdesc>
    <conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody ">
        <p class="- topic/p ">Division is the process of<b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b "> splitting </b>a number into equal parts. </p>
        <p class="- topic/p ">When using a calculator, you enter the first number, press the divide (÷ or /) button,
